<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Nickel producer QNI shares suspended.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Nickel producer QNI shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nickel producer QNI Ltd said on Tuesday that it had sought the suspension of its shares on the Australian Stock Exchange pending an announcement to be issued after a board meeting to be held on June 18.</p>
</text>
